            "review_title": "Review at Bien Ngoc Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Agnès\nEurope7 contributions\n0\nHorrible place\nMay 2026 • Couples\nHorrible experience. We had shrimp, they were overcooked and had a taste reminiscent of lighter fluid, but especially at the entrance of the restaurant, there was a small poodle-type dog, locked in a cage where it barely had room to lie down. It was directly on the wire without a basket or blanket to lie on. No food, no water. I asked for explanations and they took it out. But where and for how long?\nI regret staying in this horrible place\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten May 18, 2026",
