            "review_title": "Review at Bien Ngoc Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Sillybillies\nBrisbane, Australia72 contributions\n0\nShocking and scary\nJul 2017\nLovely setting, but a few moments after we arrived a tour bus descended and was pushed through and seated before us.\nThe waitress who had forgotten us seated us eventually and drinks and food orders were taken.\nAfter a wait of one and a half hours, we decided to pay for our drinks and go, which upset them to the extreme. On attempting to pay a menacing man (perhaps the manager) approached my husband and was up in his face and acting aggressively. \n(No apologies, we had done nothing wrong, it was a ridiculous amount of time to wait with kids for 3 dishes) \nWe hurriedly paid, too much and left as quick as we could as we had children and we were scared. We were staying at Amiana next door, and went there for a change, but I can't recommend going there at all. The only time we felt anything like aggression in our two weeks in Vietnam. \nBe warned.\nRead more\nWritten July 12, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
