            "review_text": "Abdul R\nBlacktown, Australia1 contribution\n0\nwill never go to that restaurant again!\nFeb 2014 • Friends\nOn the way to Doc Let beach we noticed nice entrance of this restaurant and decided to stop for lunch. When we came in, we understood that this place is a Russian restaurant and it seems only for Russians. A lot of Russian customers. Most of staff are Russians, they just ignored us. A lot of Russian dishes which we do not understand and nobody can explain what it is made of becasue nobody speak even little english. Beer and alcohol is overrated. Dishes are tastless Avoid this place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 14, 2014",
