            "review_title": "Review at Bien Ngoc Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Simplyloveit\nMaastricht, The Netherlands1 contribution\n0\nAvoid this place\nJan 2014\nThe restaurant looks very nice and has a very nice terrace on the ocean. However, the service was horrible. A dozen staff had nothing to do and just stared at their cell phones. When somebody finally came to the table, he tried to push the most expensive dishes. When ordering something else, that dish magically happened to be \"sold out\" and he tried to sell his expensive per kilo dish again. Ordered tuna curry, but the tuna was so overcooked that I could not tell if it was from this week or last week. Complaining did not have any effect. When getting up to leave, they still demanded the full bill was paid. \nAvoid this place at all cost! This is the only bad experience with food after 3 weeks in Vietnam.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 11, 2014",
